 an underlined word and click the suggested word to accept it, or click Ignore."}],["$","li","1",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"To go through the whole document, click Spelling and grammar check on the toolbar (at the top left). A box opens at the top right: click Change to use a suggestion or Ignore to skip it. More › Accept all or Ignore all handles every suggestion at once."}],["$","li","2",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"Read it yourself too. A checker cannot tell that you typed the wrong apartment number."}]]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6","children":"Word count and Find and replace"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-6","children":[["$","ul","0",{"className":"list-disc pl-6 space-y-3 text-gray-700 marker:text-primary-500","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"Tools › Word count (Ctrl+Shift+C) shows pages, words, and characters. Check Display word count while typing to keep a count on screen."}],["$","li","1",{"className":"leading-relaxed pl-1","children":"Edit › Find and replace (Ctrl+H): type what to find and what to replace it with, then click Replace or Replace all. Check Match case when capital letters matter."}]]}],["$","$L1f","1",{"block":{"type":"drag-drop","mode":"order","title":"Finish a document in order","prompt":"Put the finishing steps in a sensible order.","items":[{"id":"s1","text":"Run Spelling and grammar check"},{"id":"s2","text":"Use Find and replace to make names consistent"},{"id":"s3","text":"Read the whole document yourself"},{"id":"s4","text":"Print or download the final copy"},{"id":"s5","text":"Send it to the reader"}],"explanation":"Fix errors first, then read it as the reader will, and only then print or send. Every copy you send is a copy you cannot fix later."}}]]}]]}],"$L20","$L21"]}]}]]}]
1b:["$","div",null,{"id":"practice-simulation","className":"mb-12 scroll-mt-24","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-[40px] sm:leading-[1.05]","children":"Practice Simulation"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-soft","children":"Practice what this lesson taught in a working copy of the app. Tasks appear under the window, just like GMetrix."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-10","style":{"width":"min(1360px, calc(100vw - 2rem))","marginLeft":"calc((100% - min(1360px, calc(100vw - 2rem))) / 2)"},"children":[["$","$L22","gw-m3-finish",{"sim":{"id":"gw-m3-finish","app":"google","title":"Proofread and send the move-in letter","scenario":"Tina Okafor moves into Elm Street apartment 2C this week. Her welcome letter has a typo and inconsistent street names. Proofread it, then print it for the move-in packet, email her a PDF, and keep a copy to reuse for the next tenant.","fileName":"Move-In Letter - Elm 2C","minutes":6,"initial":{"surface":"docs","open":"f1","tabs":["f1"],"me":{"name":"Jordan Lee","email":"jlee@parkviewpm.example","color":"#1a73e8"},"org":{"name":"Parkview Property Management","domain":"parkviewpm.example"},"people":[{"name":"Denise Carter","email":"dcarter@parkviewpm.example","color":"#188038"},{"name":"Marcus Reyes","email":"mreyes@parkviewpm.example","color":"#e8710a"},{"name":"Kim Nguyen","email":"knguyen@parkviewpm.example","color":"#9334e6"},{"name":"Priya Shah","email":"pshah@parkviewpm.example","color":"#d93025"},{"name":"Andre Wallace","email":"awallace@parkviewpm.example","color":"#12858a"},{"name":"Tony Russo","email":"tony@russoplumbing.example","color":"#b06000"}],"files":[{"id":"f1","name":"Move-In Letter - Elm 2C","kind":"doc","parent":"root","modified":"Oct 19, 2026","content":{"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1","style":"Title","text":"Welcome to Elm Street Apartments"},{"id":"p2","text":"Dear Tina Okafor,"},{"id":"p3","runs":[{"text":"Welcome to Elm St. Apartments! Your apartment, 2C, is ready for you. Parkview Property "},{"id":"r2","text":"Managment","misspelled":true,"suggestions":["Management"]},{"text":" is here to help."}]},{"id":"p4","text":"The Elm St. laundry room is on the first floor. Parking is behind the building."},{"id":"p5","text":"Please bring this letter to the office when you pick up your keys."},{"id":"p6","text":"Sincerely,"},{"id":"p7","text":"Jordan Lee, Office Assistant"}]}}]},"tasks":[{"instruction":"Fix the misspelled word “Managment”.","hint":"Right-click the word with the red underline and click Management. Or click Spelling and grammar check on the toolbar and click Change.","steps":[{"action":{"kind":"command","id":"spelling.change","value":"Management"},"requires":{"selection":"p3.r2"},"selectHint":"Right-click the misspelled word “Managment” first."}]},{"instruction":"Replace every “Elm St.” with “Elm Street”.","hint":"Edit › Find and replace (Ctrl+H). Type Elm St. in Find and Elm Street in Replace with, then click Replace all.","steps":[{"action":{"kind":"dialog","id":"replace","values":{"find":"Elm St.","replace":"Elm Street"}}}]},{"instruction":"Check the letter's word count.","hint":"Tools › Word count, or press Ctrl+Shift+C. Click OK when you have read it.","steps":[{"action":{"kind":"command","id":"g.pane","value":"Word count"}}]},{"instruction":"Print 2 copies on the Front Desk Printer for the move-in packet.","hint":"File › Print (Ctrl+P). Keep Front Desk Printer as the destination, change Copies to 2, and click Print.","steps":[{"action":{"kind":"dialog","id":"g.print","values":{"destination":"Front Desk Printer","copies":2}}}]},{"instruction":"Email the letter to Tina (tokafor@example.com) as a PDF attachment.","hint":"File › Email › Email this file. Type tokafor@example.com in To, keep PDF under Attach as, and click Send.","steps":[{"action":{"kind":"dialog","id":"g.email","values":{"to":"tokafor@example.com","format":"PDF"}}}]},{"instruction":"Make a copy of the letter named “Move-In Letter - Template” to reuse for the next tenant.","hint":"File › Make a copy. Type Move-In Letter - Template as the name and click Make a copy.","steps":[{"action":{"kind":"dialog","id":"g.makeCopy","values":{"name":"Move-In Letter - Template"}}}]}]}}]]}]]}]
